{"id":"690b56cc2bd757f4","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/579_认识逻辑_Epistemic_Logic.md","title":"579 认识逻辑 Epistemic Logic","display":"579_认识逻辑_Epistemic_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号与显示约定\">1. 原始符号与显示约定</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{579}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{579}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:k\\to X\\ (Y=\\{e(i):i&lt;k\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{know}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{know}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>显示为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,KA\">\\(p,\\bot,\\neg A,A\\to B,KA\\)</span>。派生记号为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Diamond_KA:=\\neg K\\neg A\">\\(\\Diamond_KA:=\\neg K\\neg A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{579}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{579}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\">\\(\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{know}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\">\\(\\operatorname{know}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元与替换\">3. 自由变元与替换</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{579}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{579}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{579}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{579}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{579}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{579}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{579}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{579}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{579}(p)=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{579}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{579}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{PV}_{579}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PV}_{579}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{579}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{579}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{579}(KA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{579}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PV}_{579}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{PV}_{579}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{PV}_{579}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{PV}_{579}(KA)=\\operatorname{PV}_{579}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{579}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{579})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{579}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\to\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{579})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{579}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{579}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,579}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\alpha,579}\\)</span> 为构造树相等。定义有限支撑替换集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{579}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{579}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{579}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{579})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{579}\n=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}_{579}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}_{579}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop}_{579})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{579}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{579}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{579}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{579}\\)</span>，</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}(A,\\sigma),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}(p,\\sigma)=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}(\\bot,\\sigma)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}(\\neg A,\\sigma)=\\neg\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}(A,\\sigma),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}(B,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}(KA,\\sigma)=K\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}(A,\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}(A\\to B,\\sigma)=\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}(A,\\sigma)\\to\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}(B,\\sigma),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}(KA,\\sigma)=K\\operatorname{Sub}_{579}(A,\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{579}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{579}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{579}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{579}\n=\n\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{579}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{579}\n=\n\\{(\\neg B\\to\\neg A)\\to(A\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{579}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{579}=\\{\\neg\\bot\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>知识公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{579}=\\{K(A\\to B)\\to(KA\\to KB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{579}=\\{K(A\\to B)\\to(KA\\to KB):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{579}=\\{KA\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{579}=\\{KA\\to A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{579}=\\{KA\\to KKA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{579}=\\{KA\\to KKA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{579}=\\{\\neg KA\\to K\\neg KA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{579}=\\{\\neg KA\\to K\\neg KA:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{579}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{579}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{579}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{579}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{579}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{579}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{579}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{579}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{579}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{579}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{C1}^{579}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C2}^{579}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{C3}^{579}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\bot}^{579}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{579}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{579}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{579}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{579}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则\">5. 推理规则</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{579}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK}^{579}=\\{((A),KA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{579}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK}^{579}=\\{((A),KA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{KA}\\ (Nec_K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\qquad A\\to B}{B}\\ (MP),\n\\qquad\n\\frac{A}{KA}\\ (Nec_K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{579}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{579}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK}^{579}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{579}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{579}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK}^{579}\n\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{579}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{579}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是所有非空有限序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\">\\(((\\Delta_0,A_0),\\ldots,(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}))\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\)</span>，并且每行满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{579}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{579}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{579}\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{579}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK}^{579}\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK}^{579}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{579}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{579}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{579}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{579}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{579}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{579}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{579}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{579}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{579}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \n\\operatorname{last}_{579}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{579}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{579}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{579}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{579}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-知识算子证书\">8. 知识算子证书</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"579\">\\(579\\)</span>-知识证书集合定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CertTag}_{579}=\\{\\mathsf{K},\\mathsf{T},\\mathsf{4},\\mathsf{5}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CertTag}_{579}=\\{\\mathsf{K},\\mathsf{T},\\mathsf{4},\\mathsf{5}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{579}={}&amp;\n\\{(\\mathsf{K},A,B,K(A\\to B)\\to(KA\\to KB)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{T},A,KA\\to A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{4},A,KA\\to KKA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{5},A,\\neg KA\\to K\\neg KA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Cert}_{579}={}&amp;\n\\{(\\mathsf{K},A,B,K(A\\to B)\\to(KA\\to KB)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{T},A,KA\\to A):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{4},A,KA\\to KKA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\cup\\{(\\mathsf{5},A,\\neg KA\\to K\\neg KA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{579}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>每个证书的末分量分别属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{579}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{K}^{579}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{579}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{T}^{579}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{579}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{4}^{579}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{579}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{5}^{579}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目只有一个原始知识算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>；它不同于第 580 条的主体索引族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_a\">\\(K_a\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-整个句法形式系统\">10. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal Epi_{579}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{579},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{579},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{579},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{579},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,579},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{579},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{579},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{579},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{579},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK}^{579},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{579},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{579},\n\\operatorname{last}_{579},\\vdash_{579},\\mathsf{Thm}_{579},\\mathsf{CertTag}_{579},\\mathsf{Cert}_{579}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal Epi_{579}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Prop}_{579},\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{579},\n\\operatorname{PV}_{579},\n\\operatorname{BV}_{579},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,579},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{579},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{579},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{579},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{579},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{NecK}^{579},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{579},\n\\mathsf{Proof}_{579},\n\\operatorname{last}_{579},\\vdash_{579},\\mathsf{Thm}_{579},\\mathsf{CertTag}_{579},\\mathsf{Cert}_{579}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含单主体认识逻辑句法、公理、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含 Kripke 语义或知识分析。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号与显